// DailyQuestionsData.swift
// Question-of-the-day pack: both partners answer, then compare.
// Mix of reflective, playful, deep, future-dreams, memories, gratitude and spicy-lite questions.
//
// Every question carries an editorial `depth` tag:
//   .light — everyday, playful, answerable in one breath
//   .close — relational, warm, a little self-disclosure
//   .deep  — vulnerable, big feelings, wants a calm evening
// The delivery cycle (ContentPack.dailyQuestionCycle) uses the tags to keep
// the mix gentle: never three deep questions on three consecutive days.
//
// Ids are append-only and NEVER renumbered — the journal pins answered days
// by question id.

